{
  "about": [
    "The Wiki while it has nothing to read (design §12.3.1, mock 41), on the three clients: the setup card every",
    "state of the plan draws, whether it is drawn, and the workspaces its two forms offer. `states` holds one card",
    "for each state of `plan.states` in wiki-docs.fixture.json, read with `context`, with `directory` the docs",
    "directory of that fixture once a version is confirmed. The web reads this file in `lib/wikiStart.test.ts`,",
    "OrbitKit in `WikiStartParityTests`, Android in `WikiStartLogicTest`, and the server holds `repositories` to",
    "its `normalizeRepoUrl` in `wiki-repository-name.spec.ts`. Dates are read in `timeZone`; «ago» against `now`.",
    "`firstDrafts` and `writingOffline` are states `plan.states` does not reach: a draft with no version confirmed yet,",
    "and documents whose writing waits for an offline runner."
  ],
